n  }\n\n  .swatch {\n    width: 14px;\n    height: 14px;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n  }\n\n  .swatch.blue {\n    background: var(--blue);\n  }\n\n  .swatch.cyan {\n    background: var(--cyan);\n  }\n\n  .swatch.pale {\n    background: var(--pale-blue);\n  }\n\n  .percent {\n    text-align: right;\n  }\n\n  .conclusion {\n    margin-top: 70px;\n  }\n\n  .conclusion .section-title {\n    font-size: 31px;\n  }\n\n  .syringe-placeholder {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 520px;\n    margin-top: 18px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n    justify-content: center;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    color: rgba(8, 46, 104, .5);\n    font-size: 13px;\n    padding-bottom: 14px;\n    background:\n      linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 47%, #bfc3c8 47.5% 48.5%, transparent 49%),\n      linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 44%, #e4c300 44% 52%, transparent 52%),\n      radial-gradient(ellipse at 52% 87%, rgba(230, 219, 214, .78) 0 25%, transparent 25.5%);\n  }\n\n  .footer {\n    margin-top: 20px;\n  }\n\n  .bottom-rule {\n    margin: 0 4px 38px;\n  }\n\n  .citation {\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    max-width: 1450px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 21px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 1800px) {\n    body {\n      justify-content: flex-start;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"poster\">\n  <header class=\"hero\">\n    <div class=\"hero-text\">\n      <h1>Uncontrolled type 1 diabetes among Egyptian<br>adolescents: risk determinants and clinical outcomes</h1>\n      <p class=\"authors\">Safinaz Adel Elhabashya, Eman M Mounir Sherifa, Nouran Yousef Salaha,<br>Mostafa Ahmed Elsayed Abd Elkaderb, Dina Ahmed Hosney Youssefa</p>\n      <p class=\"affiliation\">Pediatrics Department, Faculty of Medicine, Ain Shams University, Cairo, Egypt</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"placeholder hero-image\">[Image: hands holding a stethoscope, right]</div>\n  </header>\n\n  <div class=\"top-rule\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"columns\">\n    <div class=\"left-column\">\n      <section class=\"section\">\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">Introduction</h2>\n        <p>Adolescents are exposed to multiple developmental, cognitive and emotional challenges, including independence and autonomy acquisition, identity and self esteem development, and social bond creation.</p>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"section\">\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">Aim</h2>\n        <p>To assess the risk determinants and clinical outcomes of uncontrolled diabetes among Egyptian adolescents with T1D.</p>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"section\">\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">Methodology</h2>\n        <ol class=\"method-list\">\n          <li>\n            <span class=\"number\">1</span>\n            Six hundred adolescents with T1D were recruited from the Pediatric and Adolescents Diabetology Clinic, Ain-Shams University.\n          </li>\n          <li>\n            <span class=\"number\">2</span>\n            From the studied cohort, 200 with good glycemic control (≤7%) and 200 with poor control (&gt;7%) were assessed for diabetes-duration, insulin regimen, frequency of diabetic-ketoacidosis, clinically significant hypoglycemia and the Mini-International Neuropsychiatric-Interview for Children and Adolescents.\n          </li>\n          <li>\n            <span class=\"number\">3</span>\n            Auxological assessment, fundus and clinical screening for complications were done.\n          </li>\n          <li>\n            <span class=\"number\">4</span>\n            Neuropathy was confirmed by nerve conduction velocity.\n          </li>\n          <li>\n            <span class=\"number\">5</span>\n            Thyroid profile, anti-tissue transglutaminase-IgG, fasting lipids and urinary albumin/excretion ratio (UAE) were measured.\n          </li>\n        </ol>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"middle-column\">\n      <section class=\"section\">\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">Results</h2>\n        <p class=\"results-intro\">Adolescents, having uncontrolled diabetes have significantly higher diabetes onset age (p = 0.037), diabetes-duration (p = 0.038), eating disorders (p = 0.027), sadness (p = 0.038), depression (p = 0.003), suicidal manifestations (p = 0.001) and anxiety (p&lt;0.001) than the well-controlled group.</p>\n\n        <table class=\"results-table\">\n          <colgroup>\n            <col>\n            <col>\n            <col>\n            <col>\n          </colgroup>\n          <thead>\n            <tr>\n              <th>Variables</th>\n              <th>Adolescents with<br>T1D (<i>n</i> = 400)</th>\n              <th>Well controlled<br>Adolescents with<br>T1D (<i>n</i> = 200)</th>\n              <th>Well controlled<br>Adolescents with<br>T1D (<i>n</i> = 200)</th>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <th>Empty Cell</th>\n              <th>r</th>\n              <th>p-value</th>\n              <th>r</th>\n            </tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Age (years)</td>\n              <td>−0.054</td>\n              <td>0.282</td>\n              <td>0.000</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Age at diabetes<br>onset (y)</td>\n              <td>0.122*</td>\n              <td>0.014</td>\n              <td>−0.011</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Diabetes<br>duration (y)</td>\n              <td>0.103*</td>\n              <td>0.039</td>\n              <td>0.098</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Insulin dosage<br>(U/kg/day)</td>\n              <td>−0.051</td>\n              <td>0.312</td>\n              <td>0.082</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Parent social<br>standard</td>\n              <td>−0.021</td>\n              <td>0.671</td>\n              <td>−0.121</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Weight z-score</td>\n              <td>−0.043</td>\n              <td>0.391</td>\n              <td>−0.025</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Height z-score</td>\n              <td>−0.081</td>\n              <td>0.106</td>\n              <td>0.065</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>BMI z-score</td>\n              <td>0.040</td>\n              <td>0.425</td>\n              <td>−0.067</td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n\n        <div class=\"placeholder photo-placeholder\">[Photo: clinician holding a stethoscope, bottom-center]</div>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"right-column\">\n      <section class=\"charts\">\n        <div class=\"chart-card\">\n          <h2 class=\"chart-title\">Generalized anxiety</h2>\n          <div class=\"donut\" aria-label=\"Generalized anxiety donut chart\"></div>\n          <div class=\"legend\">\n            <div class=\"legend-row\">\n              <span class=\"swatch blue\"></span>\n              <span>Adolescents with T1D</span>\n              <span class=\"percent\">20%</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"legend-row\">\n              <span class=\"swatch cyan\"></span>\n              <span>Well controlled Adolescents</span>\n              <span class=\"percent\">20%</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"legend-row\">\n              <span class=\"swatch pale\"></span>\n              <span>Poorly controlled Adolescents</span>\n              <span class=\"percent\">60%</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"chart-card\">\n          <h2 class=\"chart-title\">Frequency of DKA /yeared anxiety</h2>\n          <div class=\"donut\" aria-label=\"Frequency of DKA and anxiety donut chart\"></div>\n          <div class=\"legend\">\n            <div class=\"legend-row\">\n              <span class=\"swatch blue\"></span>\n              <span>Adolescents with T1D</span>\n              <span class=\"percent\">20%</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"legend-row\">\n              <span class=\"swatch cyan\"></span>\n              <span>Well controlled Adolescents</span>\n              <span class=\"percent\">20%</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"legend-row\">\n              <span class=\"swatch pale\"></span>\n              <span>Poorly controlled Adolescents</span>\n              <span class=\"percent\">60%</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"section conclusion\">\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">Conclusion</h2>\n        <p>Uncontrolled T1D among adolescents is associated with older age and psychiatric comorbidities. Furthermore, it is linked to school absenteeism, hyperlipidemia, diabetic nephropathy and neuropathy.</p>\n        <div class=\"placeholder syringe-placeholder\">[Photo: gloved hand holding a syringe, bottom-right]</div>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <footer class=\"footer\">\n    <div class=\"bottom-rule\"></div>\n    <p class=\"citation\">Elhabashy, S.A., Sherif, E.M.M., Salah, N.Y., Abd Elkader, M.A.E. and Youssef, D.A.H., 2022. Uncontrolled type 1 diabetes among Egyptian<br>adolescents: risk determinants and clinical outcomes. Diabetes Epidemiology and Management, 6, p.100051.</p>\n  </footer>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>"
